• Review shop drawings for the fabrication of aircraft/aerospace details in accordance with the configuration defined by planning.

• Participate in implementing corrective actions derived from NCR disposition, CAR action resolution and audit finding implementation requirements

• Maintain and wear all personal protective equipment (PPE) applicable to the area you will be in or the operation or task you are about to conduct. Maintain a clear-shaven face at all times during any activity regarding the use of a respirator.

