## Your main responsibilities

As an Electrical Technologist, you will work in collaboration with the Electrical teams based in Moncton and Fredericton, NB, while contributing to a variety of commercial, municipal, institutional, and industrial projects. Your main responsibilities will include:

• Demonstrate a commitment to health and safety leadership by following and promoting Englobe's Health & Safety policies, procedures, and safe work practices;

• Assist with the planning, design, and drafting of electrical systems for a variety of building and infrastructure projects;

