• Support the development of project budgets, construction cost estimates, and schedules;

• Coordinate electrical designs with multidisciplinary project teams, including mechanical, structural, civil, and environmental professionals;

• Attend client meetings, project coordination meetings, and construction progress meetings while supporting project delivery objectives.

